"without the console. The console's query routes answer with families of "
"their own (``TRAFFIC``, ``COMPARISON``, ``RANKHISTORY``, ``RULEHITS``, "
"``TIMELINE``, ``MINUTES``), whose hints the interface shows."
msgstr ""
